 default under, (c) result in the creation of any lien, security interest, charge or encumbrance upon the Company’s equity or assets under, (d) result in a violation of, or (e) require any authorization, consent, approval, exemption or other action by or notice or declaration to, or filing with, any court or administrative or governmental body or agency pursuant to the Amended and Restated Memorandum and Articles of Association of the Company in effect on the date hereof or as may be amended at or prior to completion of the contemplated Public Offering, or any material law, statute, rule or regulation to which the Company is subject, or any agreement, order, judgment or decree to which the Company is subject, except for any filings required after the date hereof under federal or state securities laws.","section":"","block":23,"table":null,"attribution":"issuer_disclosure","interpretation":"source_excerpt_not_independently_verified","source":{"accession":"0001829126-26-009070","form":"8-K","filedAt":"2026-08-19","reportDate":"2026-08-17","cik":"0002134856","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/2134856/000182912626009070/karmanlineacq_ex10-2.htm","rawPath":"sec/raw/aed51faadef9a65244cc76e3b0eee74c653da8df1ca65f6ef7c049c3df048747.bin","sha256":"aed51faadef9a65244cc76e3b0eee74c653da8df1ca65f6ef7c049c3df048747"}},{"id":"c67b1147e339c641e6a0e102197e9e22deb1eeae644bb8a8e26ace3e29486a4d","quote":"Warrant Agreement. The Company shall have entered into the Warrant Agreement on terms satisfactory to the Purchaser.","context":"No Injunction. No litigation, statute, rule, regulation, executive order, decree, ruling or injunction shall have been enacted, entered, promulgated or endorsed by or in any court or governmental authority of competent jurisdiction or any self-regulatory organization having authority over the matters contemplated hereby, which prohibits the consummation of any of the transactions contemplated by this Agreement or the Warrant Agreement.","section"